Package: bayestrials
Title: A Robust Framework for Bayesian Clinical Trial Reanalysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Aartik", "Sarma", email = "aartik.sarma@ucsf.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive R package designed for Bayesian reanalysis of clinical trials,
    combining the statistical power of 'brms' with the workflow efficiency of 'tidyverse'.
    The package enables systematic model specification, flexible parameter definition,
    and powerful visualization capabilities while maintaining reproducibility.
